# Copy to .env.test. This is the Supabase TEST project, a separate project
# from the app's in .env.local (see README, "Tests"): the suites sign up
# throwaway users and forge extraction spend up to the monthly ceilings, so
# against the app's project they would spend its budget. They refuse to run
# if this URL, or this key, is the app's. Email confirmation must be off on
# this project. The users sign in with the publishable key.
SUPABASE_TEST_URL=
SUPABASE_TEST_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=
# The TEST project's secret key (sb_secret_..., Settings -> API Keys, named
# local-runner), for the local worker runner in the Vitest suites only: it
# claims and finishes queued runs as the worker does. Never the app's key;
# the suites refuse one that is, or that isn't a secret key.
SUPABASE_TEST_SECRET_KEY=
# A real mailbox; each test user signs up as a plus-address on it
# (you+extraction-x-1a2b3c4d@...). Hosted Supabase refuses example and test
# domains. With email confirmation off, nothing is sent to it.
SUPABASE_TEST_EMAIL=
# Or, for a project that accepts it: a domain for generated addresses
# (default example.com), used only when SUPABASE_TEST_EMAIL is empty.
SUPABASE_TEST_EMAIL_DOMAIN=
